{"lines": [{"text": "In 2011, one of the richest men alive paid zero dollars in federal income tax. Legally.", "start": 0.15, "end": 6.702, "spec": {"img": 1, "ov": "hook"}, "words": [["In 2011", 0.08, 1.023], ["one", 1.295, 1.364], ["of", 1.364, 1.42], ["the", 1.432, 1.523], ["richest", 1.534, 1.989], ["men", 1.989, 2.318], ["alive", 2.466, 3.0], ["paid", 3.011, 3.398], ["zero", 3.455, 3.807], ["dollars", 3.807, 4.227], ["in", 4.239, 4.318], ["federal", 4.318, 4.648], ["income", 4.648, 4.932], ["tax", 4.943, 5.42], ["Legally", 5.784, 6.216]]}, {"text": "A delivery driver pays thousands. So how do billionaires do it? Three steps.", "start": 7.002, "end": 12.378, "spec": {"img": 2, "ov": "driver", "tr": "fade"}, "words": [["A", 0.08, 0.125], ["delivery", 0.125, 0.614], ["driver", 0.693, 1.148], ["pays", 1.148, 1.5], ["thousands", 1.5, 2.159], ["So", 2.545, 2.682], ["how", 2.693, 2.761], ["do", 2.761, 2.909], ["billionaires", 2.92, 3.511], ["do", 3.511, 3.693], ["it", 3.705, 3.852], ["Three", 4.261, 4.477], ["steps", 4.489, 5.034]]}, {"text": "Step one: buy shares, and never sell them. No sale means no tax on the gains.", "start": 12.678, "end": 17.982, "spec": {"img": 3, "ov": "s1", "tr": "fade"}, "words": [["Step", 0.091, 0.341], ["one", 0.341, 0.591], ["buy", 1.023, 1.148], ["shares", 1.159, 1.716], ["and", 1.784, 1.898], ["never", 1.898, 2.08], ["sell", 2.091, 2.318], ["them", 2.318, 2.5], ["No", 2.864, 3.023], ["sale", 3.034, 3.42], ["means", 3.568, 3.773], ["no", 3.773, 3.966], ["tax", 3.966, 4.33], ["on", 4.33, 4.398], ["the", 4.409, 4.466], ["gains", 4.466, 4.977]]}, {"text": "Step two: borrow against them to pay for your life. A loan is not income, so it is not taxed.", "start": 18.282, "end": 24.354, "spec": {"img": 4, "ov": "s2", "tr": "fade"}, "words": [["Step", 0.091, 0.33], ["two", 0.341, 0.614], ["borrow", 1.091, 1.455], ["against", 1.455, 1.761], ["them", 1.761, 1.977], ["to", 2.091, 2.159], ["pay", 2.159, 2.477], ["for", 2.489, 2.614], ["your", 2.614,